{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"pass\":false,\"problems\":[\"“他依旧没有长久安心的把握”缺少已确立历史的直接支撑。H5只确立了他希望亲近继续，H10/H11/H13只确立了满足有限以及他可以接受这种有限；这些都不能推出他对关系能否长久缺乏‘把握’。这给人物额外增加了一层关于未来保障的心理处境，并且第二条新历史又把它固化下来。删去这一前提并不影响本段成立：B3所需的‘快乐尚在便已不舍’已经可以由H3、H7解释。\"],\"unexplained\":[],\"reason\":\"主体因果链是成立的：经历过有限满足仍可被接受之后，他可以重新直接享受真实的幸福，因此B1、B2以及B3中的不舍而不焦灼都有历史根据。但“没有长久安心的把握”是一个听感和既有历史都没有确立的新前提，按绝对标准因此不合格。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "96f2538e-1aa2-4b58-b868-eae94cce3064", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261027T222719977482Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-27T22:27:41.287611+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "87829d0a6c294d04e0e26d4a6fd6055d9e926deb4520aefb376f80e547463f93", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156